WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:32.791
In verse 16.23,

2
00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.708
Lord Krishna warned –

3
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.416
if someone acts wilfully

4
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:39.833
and ignores scripture,

5
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:42.208
their downfall is certain.

6
00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:46.583
Now at the close of the chapter, in verse 16.24,

7
00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:49.541
He gives the seeker a clear direction –

8
00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:52.416
for deciding what to do and what not to do,

9
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:55.791
let scripture alone be your authority.

10
00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:02.333
Lord Krishna says –

11
00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:04.500
the standard for what should and
should not be done

12
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.541
must be scripture alone.

13
00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:11.291
Pramanam means authority or authenticity.

14
00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:14.500
Just as a sailor on the vast ocean

15
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.416
takes the support of a compass

16
00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.875
to maintain direction,

17
00:01:18.875 --> 00:01:20.250
in the same way scripture

18
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.541
keeps us connected

19
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:24.000
to life's true purpose.

20
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.583
‘Jnatva shastra-vidhanokta karma
kartum iharhasi’ –

21
00:01:28.583 --> 00:01:32.000
once you know

22
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.375
what scripture instructs,

23
00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:37.208
act accordingly.

24
00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:40.708
Not out of fear or mere ritual,

25
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.541
but because it is

26
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:46.250
what truly elevates you.

27
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.625
Why is scripture given such emphasis?

28
00:01:48.625 --> 00:01:52.000
Because our mental thoughts,
prevailing opinions,

29
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:56.416
and even traditions sometimes
can lead us astray.

30
00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:59.083
But scripture is beyond human error.

31
00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:01.625
It is eternal guidance.

32
00:02:01.625 --> 00:02:05.833
When values keep changing and
choices are limitless,

33
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:09.500
Lord Krishna leaves no ambiguity.

34
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:12.666
Make scripture your steady lighthouse

35
00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:16.000
and act accordingly.

36
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.958
This is the path to self-realisation

37
00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:21.458
and ultimately to the Supreme.

38
00:02:21.458 --> 00:02:24.708
This verse also gently reminds us

39
00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:26.583
that acting only by one's own stubborn will,

40
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:28.875
ignoring scripture,

41
00:02:28.875 --> 00:02:31.750
may feel like freedom at first,

42
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:35.125
but takes us away from lasting wellbeing.

43
00:02:35.125 --> 00:02:37.666
Just as breaking traffic rules

44
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:41.375
feels like freedom at first, but ultimately

45
00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:43.833
leads to an accident.

46
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:47.333
So the final instruction of this chapter

47
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:51.041
from Lord Krishna is simple yet profound –

48
00:02:51.041 --> 00:02:56.625
know what truly benefits you, and walk by it -

49
00:02:56.625 --> 00:03:01.250
with faith, care, and sincerity.

50
00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:09.375
You live in a world

51
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:11.750
full of opinions, trends,

52
00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.458
emotions, and noise.

53
00:03:15.458 --> 00:03:19.541
And in this whirlwind you often ask –

54
00:03:19.541 --> 00:03:22.083
‘What should I do?

55
00:03:22.083 --> 00:03:25.458
Which is the right path?’

56
00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:29.083
My answer is very simple –

57
00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:33.750
make scripture your compass.

58
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:36.625
Your mind can change.

59
00:03:36.625 --> 00:03:41.000
Your desires can tempt you.

60
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.875
The world may praise those

61
00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:48.416
who take the wrong path.

62
00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:50.958
But truth –

63
00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:54.916
truth does not change with time.

64
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:58.875
My knowledge, revealed in the scriptures,

65
00:03:58.875 --> 00:04:01.916
is meant to give you direction.

66
00:04:01.916 --> 00:04:05.000
Not to keep you in bondage,

67
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.458
but to elevate you.

68
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:14.500
If you move only by emotions or impulse,

69
00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:18.000
you may feel a sense of freedom,

70
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.291
but that freedom can lead you astray.

71
00:04:22.291 --> 00:04:27.291
Like a ship without a compass or map

72
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:31.458
that drifts far from the shore

73
00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:33.541
it was meant to reach.

74
00:04:33.541 --> 00:04:36.750
So do not ask –

75
00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.291
‘What do I feel like doing right now?’

76
00:04:40.291 --> 00:04:42.750
Instead ask –

77
00:04:42.750 --> 00:04:47.291
‘What is right according to truth?’

78
00:04:47.291 --> 00:04:52.208
And then do that with courage.

79
00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.958
Trust Me –

80
00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:59.833
I did not give you these teachings to bind you,

81
00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:03.500
but to elevate you

82
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.541
and ultimately set you free.

83
00:05:12.375 --> 00:05:14.958
Sometimes I see –

84
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:19.208
families dismiss tradition by saying

85
00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:22.500
it is old, restrictive,

86
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:25.208
or seems irrelevant.

87
00:05:25.208 --> 00:05:27.625
But think –

88
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:31.333
are you rejecting the truth itself,

89
00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:35.166
or only its surface form?

90
00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:40.875
I have never asked you for blind conformity.

91
00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:44.083
But I have certainly said –

92
00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:47.375
examine the wisdom of scripture:

93
00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:49.416
not superficially.

94
00:05:49.416 --> 00:05:51.750
Deeply. Why?

95
00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:54.916
Because scripture understood with maturity

96
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:59.458
does not pull you backward, but

97
00:05:59.458 --> 00:06:00.958
it gives you clarity

98
00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:05.291
and strength and moves you forward.

99
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:07.750
Do not abandon the entire foundation

100
00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.166
simply because a part of it

101
00:06:10.166 --> 00:06:13.208
seems unfamiliar.

102
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:17.583
Look again, think together.

103
00:06:17.583 --> 00:06:21.041
Give your family the opportunity –

104
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:24.375
to recognise this sacred knowledge

105
00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:26.083
not merely as ritual,

106
00:06:26.083 --> 00:06:30.333
but as a principle for living life.

107
00:06:30.333 --> 00:06:34.625
When truth is seen in a new light,

108
00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:38.541
tradition comes alive again.

109
00:06:38.541 --> 00:06:42.666
It connects generations rather
than dividing them.

110
00:06:42.666 --> 00:06:46.958
So before changing everything,

111
00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:50.416
read once more.

112
00:06:50.416 --> 00:06:55.333
What has already been written,

113
00:06:55.333 --> 00:06:57.541
by Me,

114
00:06:57.541 --> 00:06:58.791
for you.

115
00:06:58.791 --> 00:07:00.208
In that knowledge

116
00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:04.375
you will find not only answers from the past,

117
00:07:04.375 --> 00:07:08.791
but direction for the present too.

118
00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:18.000
You follow the rules of your workplace –

119
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.416
to maintain discipline, structure, and order.

120
00:07:21.416 --> 00:07:25.125
All this is necessary.

121
00:07:25.125 --> 00:07:28.416
But beyond those rules

122
00:07:28.416 --> 00:07:33.500
I have given you another guide –

123
00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.916
scripture.

124
00:07:35.916 --> 00:07:40.333
It does not only answer

125
00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:41.833
‘how to work,’

126
00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:46.125
it also answers ‘why to work.’

127
00:07:46.125 --> 00:07:49.250
Just as a machine comes

128
00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:52.000
with a manual –

129
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.166
showing how to operate it

130
00:07:54.166 --> 00:07:57.125
and how to fix errors –

131
00:07:57.125 --> 00:08:01.750
in the same way scripture is life's manual,

132
00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:06.291
showing the right approach in every situation.

133
00:08:06.291 --> 00:08:08.125
Your systems

134
00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:12.208
teach you efficiency, but scripture

135
00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:16.875
gives your work purpose and depth.

136
00:08:16.875 --> 00:08:20.583
Without this knowledge you may reach

137
00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:26.000
performance targets, but

138
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.916
remain empty within.

139
00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:32.250
Because if your purpose

140
00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:36.125
is not connected to your deeper nature,

141
00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:39.416
even success feels hollow.

142
00:08:39.416 --> 00:08:42.875
I have said – what to do and what not to do,

143
00:08:42.875 --> 00:08:47.625
let scripture be the standard.

144
00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:51.166
This is not to make you religious
at the workplace,

145
00:08:51.166 --> 00:08:55.708
but to keep your work anchored
in integrity, service,

146
00:08:55.708 --> 00:08:59.291
and vision.

147
00:08:59.291 --> 00:09:02.875
When you combine workplace rules

148
00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:06.708
with a spiritual foundation,

149
00:09:06.708 --> 00:09:09.916
you do not only become successful.

150
00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:13.083
You become steady too.

151
00:09:13.083 --> 00:09:16.625
And when you live with clarity

152
00:09:16.625 --> 00:09:19.250
in both worlds – professional

153
00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.083
and spiritual –

154
00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:23.791
you will find.

155
00:09:23.791 --> 00:09:28.291
You are not only rising in your position.

156
00:09:28.291 --> 00:09:32.625
You are rising in life itself.

157
00:09:32.625 --> 00:09:33.750
Reflect on this.
